\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The pipeline. Both learned components are frozen. Detections are gated to the expected class, the depth map is sampled inside each surviving box, and a two-anchor least-squares fit in disparity space maps relative depth to metres before the pinhole back-projection produces $Z$, $W$ and $H$.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{2}{The pipeline. Both learned components are frozen. Detections are gated to the expected class, the depth map is sampled inside each surviving box, and a two-anchor least-squares fit in disparity space maps relative depth to metres before the pinhole back-projection produces $Z$, $W$ and $H$}{figure.1}{}}
